/** \fn IMPORT_C void RWindowGroup::SetTextCursor(RWindowBase &aWin, const TPoint &aPos, const TTextCursor &aCursor)
Sets the text cursor.

Use this function to set a text cursor for this window group, or to change the existing text cursor's position or appearance.

\param aWin The text cursor is in this window, and is hence clipped to it and positioned relative to it.

