This function calls Close() followed by delete on the window. Use this function only when the window is allocated in its own heap cell.


<p><small>(generated from <a href="https://akawolf.org/documentation/pdk/GUID-9FFD28C7-8747-3438-84BF-44AF26ACEC7D.html#GUID-67D4F15A-0195-3003-A58B-11CD288C5543">Symbian Developer Library</a>)</small></p>
*/

